# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 18. Optional aggressive exclusions
# Uncomment only if your backend Dockerfile does not need these files.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# If the runtime image does not need README/documentation:
# README.md
# CHANGELOG.md
# CONTRIBUTING.md
# LICENSE
# NOTICE

# If tests are built in a separate image and never needed in backend context:
# backend/tests/
# tests/fixtures/

# If local config overrides should never enter images:
# config/local.*
# config/*.local.*
# config/secrets.*